---
title: "Fixing a flat bicycle tyre"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> flat
  flat: flat tyre
  wheel_off: wheel off
  tube_out: tube out
  dunked: tube in water
  patched: patch on
  new_tube: new tube
  refitted: tube back in
  pumped: pumped up
  riding: back on the road
  state holds <<choice>>
  flat --> wheel_off: next step
  wheel_off --> tube_out: next step
  tube_out --> tube_out: feel the tyre
  tube_out --> dunked: next step
  dunked --> patched: patch it [a patch in the kit]
  dunked --> new_tube: new tube
  patched --> refitted: next step
  new_tube --> refitted: next step
  refitted --> pumped: next step
  pumped --> holds: wait a minute
  holds --> riding: [holds air]
  holds --> wheel_off: [else]
  riding --> [*]: ride home
